        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We're back! FAM programming will resume on September 19th 2023. We will offer programming every Tuesday at Core Neighbourhood Youth Co-op from 4:30pm to 7:30pm.    Take a look at what we're cookin' this year:    💙Music Studio with Muskwa Lerat💙    September 19th: writing/cypher session.   Septembe"
